  "description": "This makes a total of 4 servings of Keto Sausages & Garlic Buttered Broccoli. Each serving comes out to be 477 calories, 39.1g fats, 7.8g net carbs, and 19.6g protein.",
  "servings": 4,
  "yield": [
    "4",
